c/2026-09/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_1__28.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"移美36年唔熟香港 搭港鐵問路去九龍塘狂食檸檬 好心人親自帶路 意外揭開移民港人半生辛酸史｜Juicy叮（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/497e25a3311e62ab6ea1e585c7e019e6/2026-09/20260927__KOWLOONTONG_.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T17:18:31.075259+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":437,"images":21,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}